WEBVTT

00:36.490 --> 00:37.490
Taki-sama.

00:38.660 --> 00:40.579
The train will be departing soon.

00:40.580 --> 00:41.640
Please board.

01:24.790 --> 01:25.930
Take me with you.

01:30.370 --> 01:31.820
It's simple.

01:36.370 --> 01:39.820
You just have to make me yours.

01:40.720 --> 01:45.570
Ah, your scent really
is as sweet as a flower.

02:06.020 --> 02:07.769
Your country...

02:07.770 --> 02:09.100
Your rights...

02:09.900 --> 02:11.859
Your family...

02:11.860 --> 02:13.110
You will abandon it all.

02:24.120 --> 02:26.500
Now...

02:27.290 --> 02:29.710
we will always be together, Taki.

02:40.801 --> 02:47.930
Izu

02:40.801 --> 02:47.930
presents

02:42.260 --> 02:45.095
Chapter 1

02:45.096 --> 02:47.930
My Knight

02:49.640 --> 02:53.810
Eurote, a powerful nation which
sprawls across the continent to the north,

02:53.810 --> 02:57.729
breached the <i>100 Year
Treaty</i> and invaded Deiden.

02:57.730 --> 03:00.799
The equilibrium of the jostling
alliance of smaller countries...

03:00.800 --> 03:03.300
overwhelmed by Eurote
in the previous great war,

03:03.580 --> 03:05.300
was all too fragile...

03:05.370 --> 03:09.040
and the fires of war have reached
even our own distant country.

03:10.690 --> 03:11.690
Engine Sounds?

03:13.290 --> 03:14.920
Fire at the engine sounds!

03:16.420 --> 03:17.959
Tank corps?! Thats insane!

03:17.960 --> 03:19.600
I can't correct the firing angle in time!

03:20.700 --> 03:23.500
A three-leafed rose? It can't be!

03:25.430 --> 03:26.430
It's over!

03:30.930 --> 03:35.419
This is the 15th Divison, "Rosen Maiden,
1st company calling HQ.

03:35.420 --> 03:37.020
The enemy stronghold has been destroyed.

03:37.130 --> 03:38.130
Returning to base.

03:53.900 --> 03:57.179
The commander is so <i>cool</i>!

03:57.180 --> 04:01.750
I wonder if I'll be a fine solider
like him ten years from now.

04:07.000 --> 04:08.010
I...

04:08.760 --> 04:12.139
I want to be like Captain Klaus.

04:12.140 --> 04:14.470
Huh?! You admire a guy like <i>that?</i>

04:15.000 --> 04:16.440
Hey, he's really cool!

04:16.940 --> 04:19.009
You saw him fight on
that motorcycle, didn't you?

04:19.010 --> 04:20.610
And he's a <i>knight</i>!

04:21.390 --> 04:24.179
Don't you know the rumors about him?

04:24.180 --> 04:25.180
What rumors?

04:30.390 --> 04:32.500
Uh-oh! Run for it!

04:38.900 --> 04:40.040
One, two, lift!

04:41.360 --> 04:42.420
Taki-sama!

04:43.050 --> 04:45.129
You mustn't come to a place like this!

04:45.130 --> 04:46.430
You'll get dirty.

04:47.160 --> 04:50.560
These are my men. Please let me see them.

04:56.380 --> 04:57.260
Taki-sama?

04:57.260 --> 04:58.260
Commander?

04:59.300 --> 05:01.730
All of you fought a brave
battle out there today.

05:02.300 --> 05:04.740
I am proud to have you under my command.

05:06.100 --> 05:07.100
Taki-sama!

05:16.760 --> 05:19.499
We haven't see each
other in a while, Taki-sama.

05:19.500 --> 05:21.750
Since your coming-of-age
ceremony, I believe.

05:22.420 --> 05:24.729
Oh, that long sword.

05:24.730 --> 05:29.010
Yes, it's the one you made
for my coming-of-age ceremony.

05:30.660 --> 05:32.460
Master Torieda.

05:33.040 --> 05:36.770
My blood ran cold when i saw
your name on the list of the wounded.

05:37.500 --> 05:38.800
I screwed up

05:39.210 --> 05:42.770
Well, it's nothing compared
to what's happened before.

05:48.410 --> 05:51.280
But a sword-smith's hands are his life!

05:52.850 --> 05:54.190
This is war.

05:54.900 --> 05:57.790
Better this than to see
our nation disappear.

05:58.820 --> 06:00.290
Oh, Captain?

06:00.940 --> 06:03.590
What are you doing here?

06:05.090 --> 06:07.670
You must not cry, Taki-sama.

06:13.430 --> 06:16.800
You must keep those
feelings concealed, out of sight.

06:18.380 --> 06:22.690
Because you are someone
who stands above others.

06:27.220 --> 06:29.560
You must not cry.

06:40.670 --> 06:42.210
That's where you've been?

06:42.980 --> 06:45.960
Taki, I'm going to your room.

06:55.220 --> 06:57.490
Is everything all right, Taki-sama?

06:58.730 --> 07:00.980
I heard something shatter just now...

07:02.350 --> 07:03.350
Taki-sama?

07:04.980 --> 07:05.980
Taki-sama?!

07:07.040 --> 07:10.490
It's nothing! I just
stumbled and broke a glass.

07:11.480 --> 07:13.370
Shall I send for the maid?

07:13.780 --> 07:17.790
No. I will rest now. You're dismissed.

07:18.830 --> 07:21.420
Yes, sir. Please sleep well.

07:26.870 --> 07:29.009
He's gone.

07:29.010 --> 07:31.180
Shouldn't you have called for help?

07:33.920 --> 07:37.010
Or would it be a greater
humiliation to be seen like this?

07:40.510 --> 07:41.980
Say that it hurts.

07:43.010 --> 07:46.170
Say it. Beg me to stop.

07:47.140 --> 07:49.240
Otherwise, every part...

07:51.940 --> 07:52.950
of your body...

07:57.780 --> 08:00.790
is mine to command.

08:14.880 --> 08:16.659
You're overflowing now.

08:16.660 --> 08:18.720
Did it turn you on to be made my toy?

08:23.640 --> 08:23.980
No!

08:24.560 --> 08:25.760
Relax your body.

08:33.900 --> 08:35.450
Just give it up.

08:38.490 --> 08:40.290
Let me hear your cries.

08:40.860 --> 08:42.080
<i>Real</i> cries, like you mean it.

08:46.290 --> 08:48.000
Then I'll forgive you.

08:53.130 --> 08:54.130
Never!

09:00.130 --> 09:04.060
You truly are the definition of obstinate.

09:23.160 --> 09:27.419
The first time I heard you speak
the language of your homeland,

09:27.420 --> 09:29.600
it sounded like the
warbling of a little bird.

09:30.960 --> 09:34.189
The sounds seemed to roll one
after the other, dancing on your tongue.

09:34.190 --> 09:37.160
I didn't think they were words at all.

09:43.430 --> 09:46.349
Sing to me one more time, Taki.

09:46.350 --> 09:49.309
In that "language" I've
never again heard since.

09:49.310 --> 09:52.540
And this time, I'll hear
you out to the end.

10:06.870 --> 10:08.750
Here's last week's.

10:09.370 --> 10:13.709
It's been six months now
since you came in here.

10:13.710 --> 10:15.510
How's it going?

10:16.630 --> 10:18.310
There's something wrong with this country.

10:19.630 --> 10:23.929
One division is organized for each
dominion, an independent strategic unit.

10:23.930 --> 10:26.509
The division commander is the liege lord,
and the soldiers are his vassals.

10:26.510 --> 10:30.770
Even children and the elderly
are carted off to the battlefield.

10:31.310 --> 10:34.439
Beauty alone no longer holds
any value in anyone's eyes.

10:34.440 --> 10:38.990
It's only trampled, devoured, and killed.

10:47.450 --> 10:50.340
Don't use "-sama" for that guy,

10:47.450 --> 10:52.790
"Sama" is an honorific used when addressing
someone of a particularly elevated status.

10:50.121 --> 10:52.790
Note

10:50.340 --> 10:52.790
But he's the knight Taki-sama chose!

10:53.710 --> 10:55.669
You heard what the
aide-of-camp said about him.

10:55.670 --> 10:57.259
He's just a dog.

10:57.260 --> 10:58.799
He's weird!

10:58.800 --> 11:01.720
Why would he come all
the way here to be a knight?

11:02.010 --> 11:04.619
And he has such a
bad attitude for a knight!

11:04.620 --> 11:06.600
The way he looks at
Taki-sama is scary, too.

11:07.140 --> 11:11.439
Klaus-sama is out there risking his
life and fighting alongside everyone else!

11:11.440 --> 11:12.939
And you say this?!

11:12.940 --> 11:16.430
He's a suspicious guy, who
knows what he's really doing?

11:18.360 --> 11:21.179
You sure aren't pulling
any punches there, are you?

11:21.180 --> 11:22.659
Klaus-sama!

11:22.660 --> 11:24.129
Un-oh!

11:24.130 --> 11:25.130
Run!

11:26.950 --> 11:27.990
Hey...

11:29.200 --> 11:30.200
Can you get up?

11:37.620 --> 11:40.339
Thank you so much for the
ride. Sorry for the trouble.

11:40.340 --> 11:42.679
I was going that way. Don't worry about it.

11:42.680 --> 11:45.629
So, you can understand our language, then?

11:45.630 --> 11:46.630
Yes.

11:46.720 --> 11:48.140
That's so cool.

11:48.520 --> 11:49.669
What is?

11:49.670 --> 11:52.399
I mean, you've only been here...

11:52.400 --> 11:54.520
Six months. More than enough.

12:01.480 --> 12:02.480
Why...

12:03.650 --> 12:07.660
Why does everyone always say
such disdainful things about you?

12:08.530 --> 12:11.449
Risking your life for your country,
or risking your life for Taki-sama...

12:11.450 --> 12:13.960
they both still weigh the same.

12:15.290 --> 12:17.550
Doesn't really matter to me.

12:18.160 --> 12:20.670
I just do what I want to do.

12:23.320 --> 12:25.350
That's so awesome.

12:25.840 --> 12:28.180
You're a little soft in
the head, aren't you?

12:29.050 --> 12:31.069
What did you say just now?

12:31.070 --> 12:32.350
Oh, nothing.

12:41.480 --> 12:42.519
What...

12:42.520 --> 12:43.860
..is that?

12:44.360 --> 12:45.530
Enemy attack!

12:47.130 --> 12:49.079
Issue a red alert to all the fields.

12:49.080 --> 12:50.259
Restocking complete!

12:50.260 --> 12:51.979
All vehicles prepare for sortie!

12:51.980 --> 12:54.979
Skip the equipment installation,
take them out as they are!

12:54.980 --> 12:57.750
Klaus! We leave in five minutes! Get ready!

12:58.460 --> 12:59.710
Klaus!

13:02.520 --> 13:05.010
Where is he?

13:08.330 --> 13:10.350
Shit! It's starting!

13:10.960 --> 13:11.760
Still nothing?

13:11.761 --> 13:13.720
No just a little more...

13:15.380 --> 13:17.679
quarters, this is the
front-line... come in...

13:17.680 --> 13:18.680
Got it!

13:24.780 --> 13:26.389
Reserve forces on radio silence!

13:26.390 --> 13:29.070
All other units on radio-standby,
set them to listen only!

13:31.260 --> 13:33.830
Taki-sama! Incoming
transmission on channel 307!

13:34.380 --> 13:35.909
Is that you Klaus?

13:35.910 --> 13:36.910
Where are you?

13:37.150 --> 13:38.100
Help!

13:38.101 --> 13:39.500
Please save us...!

13:40.500 --> 13:41.639
I can't hear you!

13:41.640 --> 13:42.840
You need to boost your signal.

13:42.920 --> 13:44.210
Please save us!

13:45.030 --> 13:47.470
The captain, he was
wounded shielding me...!

13:52.210 --> 13:54.850
Where are you?! Where
are you both right now!?

13:55.650 --> 13:57.620
We were heading towards the front lines...

14:00.900 --> 14:03.110
Bombs are going off all around us!

14:24.550 --> 14:26.690
Can you hear me, my master?

14:30.860 --> 14:33.160
Sorry I'm late.

14:33.640 --> 14:35.430
Heading your way now.

14:37.050 --> 14:39.190
Take this kid off my hands for me.

14:43.750 --> 14:44.750
Welcome.

14:46.110 --> 14:47.439
That's better.

14:47.440 --> 14:49.320
Now I've got a little
room to do some fighting.

14:50.090 --> 14:52.350
I can't believe you brought
a <i>child </i>to the battlefield!

14:53.240 --> 14:55.160
You can scold me when I get back.

14:56.100 --> 14:57.100
Are you injured?

14:57.700 --> 14:58.790
Just a couple scrapes.

15:00.580 --> 15:01.580
Taki.

15:03.250 --> 15:05.360
Give me your passion and your fury.

15:05.960 --> 15:08.800
Let me hear your voice,

15:10.210 --> 15:15.430
and I will make it a sword to
repel all that stands in your way.

15:17.450 --> 15:18.450
That is the reason...

15:19.360 --> 15:20.580
I'm here.

15:26.010 --> 15:28.139
I call upon every man
who sees me standing here!

15:28.140 --> 15:30.410
Lay everything on the line, and obey me!

15:31.680 --> 15:32.680
Don't falter!

15:33.000 --> 15:34.000
Do not doubt!

15:34.870 --> 15:37.279
Trample those who would trample you!

15:37.280 --> 15:39.680
Smash apart this barbaric
and unjust invasion!

15:41.410 --> 15:43.040
Every man who hears my call!

15:43.820 --> 15:47.570
Stand firm! Destroy the enemy,
and take back what is yours!

15:59.250 --> 16:00.430
They're retreating.

16:01.680 --> 16:03.310
Is it over?

16:04.140 --> 16:05.140
No.

16:09.240 --> 16:10.330
Klaus-sama!

16:11.900 --> 16:12.900
I'm back.

16:15.900 --> 16:17.080
Good work.

16:17.620 --> 16:19.949
Klaus-sama, um, I...

16:19.950 --> 16:20.950
Talk later.

16:21.650 --> 16:24.920
Gather the remaining wounded
and fall back immediately!

16:46.660 --> 16:49.400
Is that your answer?

16:59.040 --> 17:00.160
Sorry about this.

17:00.680 --> 17:03.580
I feel like I won't be able
to sleep until I've taken you.

17:09.000 --> 17:11.119
Go on, try to call for help.

17:11.120 --> 17:14.600
Not that you could, of course.

17:15.200 --> 17:19.050
The disgrace would tarnish your reputation
wouldn't it? Taki Reizen.

17:22.830 --> 17:24.099
This time...

17:24.100 --> 17:25.890
I'm going to put it all inside you.

17:27.660 --> 17:28.660
No!

17:30.840 --> 17:32.840
I'm sure it was around here...

17:40.700 --> 17:41.830
It's too late to run now!

17:51.750 --> 17:52.879
St-Stop!-!

17:52.880 --> 17:53.880
Stop!-!

17:56.340 --> 17:57.510
Klaus-sama!

18:00.460 --> 18:03.260
It's me, Cadet Yamamoto.

18:09.260 --> 18:12.180
I guess he went to bed already.

18:19.760 --> 18:20.760
What do you want?

18:21.150 --> 18:22.509
Klaus-sama!

18:22.510 --> 18:26.700
Sorry, but I'm about to
turn in. Talk where you are.

18:27.180 --> 18:30.040
Um, thank you very much for today!

18:31.560 --> 18:36.079
If you hadn't saved me back there, Captain,
I'm sure I would have been...

18:36.080 --> 18:40.540
Don't worry about it. I'm the one
who took you to the front-lines.

18:43.660 --> 18:46.849
Klaus..I can't...

18:46.850 --> 18:48.350
Please, no more...

18:48.710 --> 18:49.940
Please!

18:54.500 --> 18:55.650
Klaus-sama?

18:56.650 --> 18:58.370
I thought I heard...

19:01.600 --> 19:02.600
Klaus-sama!

19:05.510 --> 19:07.660
What, you still there?

19:08.690 --> 19:09.290
U-Umm...

19:09.291 --> 19:10.459
U-Umm...

19:10.460 --> 19:12.269
I have something I'd like to tell you.

19:12.270 --> 19:13.490
Tell me later.

19:14.600 --> 19:15.880
It will only take a moment.

19:18.520 --> 19:25.430
On the front-lines, when the enemy soldiers
found us, I was so paralyzed with fear.

19:26.100 --> 19:26.970
I couldn't... i

19:26.971 --> 19:28.140
do anything.

19:30.240 --> 19:34.410
I always admired you and Taki-sama.
I always wanted to be like both of you,

19:35.000 --> 19:39.770
and fight to protect my country and its
people, and yet I couldn't do anything.

19:41.340 --> 19:43.159
I will become stronger!

19:43.160 --> 19:46.580
Strong enough to never again cower
when I am called upon to fight.

19:47.310 --> 19:49.370
Strong enough to protect what's dear to me.

19:50.400 --> 19:52.090
I will become stronger!

19:53.020 --> 19:56.380
I just felt like I had to
tell you this, Klaus-sama.

20:00.980 --> 20:02.090
I see.

20:05.410 --> 20:08.890
If that is truly your wish, then
I acknowledge your resolve.

20:09.280 --> 20:10.280
Sir!

20:10.590 --> 20:12.830
Please excuse the disruption!

20:13.330 --> 20:14.770
Rest well!

20:16.730 --> 20:18.980
He's gone. Stop muffling your cries.

20:20.680 --> 20:21.970
Have you no shame?!

20:23.500 --> 20:30.120
To betray a boy who admires you
so earnestly with such sordid acts...!

20:33.090 --> 20:34.090
I see...

20:35.810 --> 20:37.550
That's what you thought of this?

20:41.960 --> 20:42.670
It hurts!! Kla!

20:42.670 --> 20:43.670
It hurts, Kla-!

20:44.530 --> 20:46.539
You're the shamless one here!

20:46.540 --> 20:51.519
How did it feel, to stifle your cries with
me thrusting deep all the way inside you?

20:51.520 --> 20:52.520
Answer me!

20:52.820 --> 20:56.480
Why do you refuse me so? Why now?

20:58.210 --> 21:02.410
Weren't you the one who
first said you wanted me?!

21:14.320 --> 21:15.370
Forgive me.

21:21.790 --> 21:22.799
Hey!

21:22.800 --> 21:23.800
Taki!

21:24.020 --> 21:25.020
Taki!

21:25.110 --> 21:26.110
Hey!

21:26.590 --> 21:27.800
Answer me!

21:34.470 --> 21:35.470
Taki!

21:36.770 --> 21:37.770
TAKI!

21:45.230 --> 21:47.210
Cadet Haruki Yamamoto.

21:54.520 --> 21:57.690
Oh! That's Klaus-sama's bag.

21:58.330 --> 22:03.100
He threw it out of the sidecar
to make room for the radio.

22:03.550 --> 22:05.239
You're absolutely certain?

22:05.240 --> 22:06.249
Yes.

22:06.250 --> 22:08.519
I'm so glad it was found...

22:08.520 --> 22:11.549
Arrest Klaus von Wolfstadt immediately!

22:11.550 --> 22:12.550
Yes!

22:16.180 --> 22:17.789
That filthy dog...

22:17.790 --> 22:20.480
Why? What has Klaus-sama done?!

22:21.770 --> 22:26.990
Classified documents belonging to our and the Western
alliance's armies were discovered in that bag!

22:28.310 --> 22:28.950
That...

22:28.951 --> 22:30.170
That can't be!

22:38.060 --> 22:39.880
I didn't come to this country...

22:41.540 --> 22:44.439
to do something like this.

22:56.560 --> 23:00.190
Translation

23:00.191 --> 23:03.819
Henna

23:03.820 --> 23:04.440
- Translation
- Henna

